{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-09/1063358/block/singleImage/3264955/df/01M3DS5MY8EMRWZXKPBNB9111S.jpg?updatedAt=1794448222\"/><figcaption>威爾斯親王醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>沙田發生女子暈倒後死亡事件。 昨日（11日）晚上11時許，一名45歲女子於沙田正街偉華中心一個單位內暈倒，其母親發現後報警求助。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，發現女子已經陷入昏迷，由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理，可惜最終不治，死因有待驗屍後確定。警方正在調查事件。據了解，林女患有身體病。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:43:54.970722+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T01:50:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T11:17:13.627247+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:37:13.943825+00:00","content_hash":"6b0d1a984d6459e8dbb417630402b1d087827f7f7aedb25305c5c2e2d9363155","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:43:54.970722+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}